 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kanojo No Endororu ～ Sayonara Made Atohantoshi ～"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "彼女のエンドロール～さよならまであと半年～"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "If it's so wonderful, I want to fall in love, too... I'm betting my last six months of life on my first and last love.\n\nRai Kamikuzu, who is living as a dependent using his good looks, has no place to stay since he was kicked out. [“Will you be my lover under a contract of 1 million yen for a month and 6 million yen for six months?”] \nMakoto, a simple woman passing by, picks him up and makes a contract with him to be his girlfriend for six months. Makoto, who says she has never been interested in love before, says she wants to fall in love with a man she bought with her money...? \n\nThis is the last love story of a scumbag man and a serious girl who has only half a year to live!",
   "ja": "そんなに素敵なものなら私も恋をしてみたい――余命半年を賭けた最初で最後の恋。\nビジュアルの良さを生かしてヒモ生活をしている神葛 来（かみくず らい）は、寄生先を追い出されて宿ナシ状態…。\n「1ヵ月100万、半年600万円の契約で私の恋人になってくれませんか？」通りすがりの地味女・真（まこと）に拾われて、半年間の恋人契約をすることに。今まで恋愛に興味がなかったという真は、金で買った男と恋愛をしてみたいと言っていて…!? クズメン×余命半年の真面目女子のラスト・ラブ！"
  },
